<title>SLOVAKIA: Bratislava bourse suspends trading till Jan 7.</title>
<headline>Bratislava bourse suspends trading till Jan 7.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bratislava Stock Exchange ended trading for this year after Thursday's close and will resume on Tuesday, January 7 next year.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563 3687</p>
